{"resource": {"name": "State of Vermont Grants Issued", "id": "xifk-zskz", "parent_fxf": [], "description": "Beginning in SFY2014, the Department of Finance and Management was required by 32 VSA \u00a7314 to issue an annual report of all grants issued. (In 2012 to 2013, the Department began a pilot program to include non-federal grants in its database and those reports are available separately.)\r\n\r\nAwards included in this dataset have been awarded (authorized) by a State of Vermont department to the grantee during the report year. This funding may or may not have been expended or received by the grantee during that year. In the case of multi-year grants, the grant award is included in the year in which the grant was originally issued, and is not included each year for the duration of the award. If a grant is subsequently amended, it is not updated in this report.", "attribution": null, "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-02-14T18:20:03.000Z", "createdAt": "2018-01-03T14:33:08.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-02-14T18:19:59.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-02-14T18:20:03.000Z", "columns_name": ["End Date", "Granting Department", "Grant Description", "Funding Source", "Zip", "CFDA #", "Fiscal Year Issued", "Grantee Name", "Address Line 1", "Address Line 2", "City", "Grant Number", "ST", "Start Date", "Award Amount"], "columns_field_name": ["end_date", "granting_department", "grant_description", "funding_source", "zip", "cfda", "fiscal_year_issued", "grantee_name", "address_line_1", "address_line_2", "city", "grant_number", "st", "start_date", "award_amount"], "columns_datatype": ["Calendar date", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Calendar date", "Number"], "columns_description": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "columns_format": [{"view": "default_date_time"}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": 